NOTICE — doccornernet_lean.ort

DocCornerNet (lean), a channel-slimmed SimCC document-corner detector with a
MobileNetV2 backbone, as published in the scanic-ml npm package (v0.2.0) by
marquaye, derived from DocCornerNet-CoordClass by mapo80. Architecture after
Li et al., "SimCC: a Simple Coordinate Classification Perspective for Human
Pose Estimation", ECCV 2022. Training data per the model card: MIDV,
SmartDoc, COCO (negatives) and Roboflow community sets (see
MODEL_CARD.doccornernet.md).

The same file is served to browsers from frontend/public/scan/v2/.

